The '''Archos 101 Oxygen''' (model AC101OX) is a 10.1" tablet from 2015 built around the Rockchip [[Rockchip RK3288|RK3288]]. It runs a mainline kernel in postmarketOS, booted by the stock Rockchip U-Boot.

